              "Categories": {
                "value": "CC-Zero|Self-published work|Featured pictures of ice|Images by W.carter|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation|Close-up photographs of snow crystals glittering in light|Featured pictures of Lysekil Municipality|Featured photographs in the public domain|Featured pictures taken with compact digital camera|Images by W.carter, my own favorites|Snow in Lysekil Municipality|Featured pictures by W.carter",
